      "created_at": "2020-06-16T18:09:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>1. &nbsp;Yes, as long as they didn't drop that power associated with the Green ability in a particular form&nbsp;it's available to them&nbsp;</p>\n<p>2. &nbsp;For that bird form you'd have to drop a power and pick up Flight using the die of what you dropped. &nbsp;Assuming they didn't have Flight as a power already.</p>\n<p>3. &nbsp;I personally don't see an issue with it but the idea seems to be limited to powers in the archetype&nbsp;</p>",
