      "created_at": "2020-06-16T20:17:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Qualities are skills and knowledge, not inherent capabilities.&nbsp; In hippo form they'd still know how to be stealthy, but their poor Agility power would make it tougher.&nbsp; Unless they're underwater... and if you've ever seen hippos in real life, they should be very good at a Swimming + Stealth check!</p>",
